WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.139 --> 00:00:03.299
We've come to the end of our course

2
00:00:03.299 --> 00:00:05.669
and I do hope you've enjoyed yourself.

3
00:00:05.669 --> 00:00:07.950
In this course, the topics we covered were

4
00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:11.109
quick overview of the templates currently available.

5
00:00:11.109 --> 00:00:14.000
We then explored the UI a little bit more

6
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.289
and how to access assets and placing them in our scene.

7
00:00:18.289 --> 00:00:21.789
A quick overview of how to access and place materials.

8
00:00:21.789 --> 00:00:23.449
We then looked at where to find lighting

9
00:00:23.449 --> 00:00:26.460
and placing them as well as some settings.

10
00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:30.120
We then discussed how to make the seasons change.

11
00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:35.310
Finally, we discussed one of many ways to share your project.

12
00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:37.350
Now Twinmotion is a very powerful tool

13
00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:39.310
and there's so much more to learn.

14
00:00:39.310 --> 00:00:41.189
There are a series of in-depth courses

15
00:00:41.189 --> 00:00:42.670
