16
00:00:42.670 --> 00:00:44.909
the various tools within Twinmotion

17
00:00:44.909 --> 00:00:47.469
that can help you to achieve the desired look

18
00:00:47.469 --> 00:00:48.950
and feel that you are wanting

19
00:00:48.950 --> 00:00:51.390
to communicate to your viewer.

20
00:00:51.390 --> 00:00:53.789
Until then, take some time to explore everything

21
00:00:53.789 --> 00:00:57.789
